OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree parade resolution not
OL,4,Agoing to be easy - NI secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe secretary of state for Northern
OL,7,FIreland has warned that a resolution to
OL,8,Fthe Drumcree parading dispute was "not
OL,9,Fgoing to be easy" but said the
OL,10,Fgovernment would "go the extra mile for
OL,11,Fpeace".
OL,13,FSir Chris Bryant said the situation was
OL,14,F"tense" and added that "nobody wants
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland to return to the
OL,16,F1990s".
OL,18,FProtesters remained on the Garvaghy
OL,19,FRoad overnight, while Orangemen also
OL,20,Fmaintained a presence at Drumcree
OL,21,Fchurch, but were smaller in number than
OL,22,Fprevious nights.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
