OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree parade resolution not
OL,4,Agoing to be easy - NI secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Chris was speaking at the annual
OL,7,FLabour Party conference in Liverpool
OL,8,Fahead of returning to Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fon Tuesday afternoon for further talks.
